    matrix:  A `Tensor`. Must be `float16`, `float32`, `float64`, `complex64`,
      or `complex128` with shape `[..., M, M]`.
    name:  A name to give this `Op` (optional).

  Returns:
    The adjoint (a.k.a. Hermitian transpose a.k.a. conjugate transpose) of
    matrix.

