Transposes the last two dimensions of and conjugates tensor `matrix`.

  For example:

  ```python
  x = tf.constant([[1 + 1j, 2 + 2j, 3 + 3j],
                   [4 + 4j, 5 + 5j, 6 + 6j]])
  tf.linalg.adjoint(x)  # [[1 - 1j, 4 - 4j],
                        #  [2 - 2j, 5 - 5j],
                        #  [3 - 3j, 6 - 6j]]
  ```

